# Append-only lists merge by keeping both sides' lines (DE-00000091).
#
# Two sessions that each add a changelog line or archive a record touch the same
# file; `merge=union` keeps both additions instead of stopping on a conflict.
# Never give this attribute to a list that deletes rows: a union merge brings
# back every row one side removed (replaying this repository's merges resurrected
# closed cards in 13 of 18 cases). The active, review, and planned work lists are
# therefore not files at all; Stage derives them from card status.

# Plugin changelogs: card work only adds lines under `## Unreleased`.
CHANGELOG.md merge=union

# Official archive indexes: archiving only appends a row.
.stage/official/**/archive/index.md merge=union
